## 1. Scope

This validation plan covers release v0.1.0 of the Complaint Impact Classifier pilot project.

The validation scope includes:

- Synthetic dataset generation
- Dataset validation and quality checks
- Dataset splitting and reproducibility controls
- Feature engineering controls
- Machine learning training process
- Model evaluation process
- Traceability and configuration controls
- Validation evidence generation

Out of scope:

- Production deployment
- Real-world users
- Real customer data
- External integrations
- Continuous monitoring environment

