## 3. Validation strategy and risk-based approach

Validation follows a risk-based approach as defined in SOP-003 and SOP-006.

This scaling approach is a team convention.

| Risk Level | Validation Depth |
|---|---|
| High (H) | Full IQ, OQ, PQ and TMV when applicable |
| Medium (M) | IQ, OQ and PQ |
| Low (L) | IQ and OQ only |

The Complaint Impact Classifier project contains several high-risk controls related to:

- Data leakage
- Incorrect performance reporting
- Loss of traceability
- Use of non-synthetic data

Therefore full validation coverage shall be applied.

No acceptance criteria may be modified after execution.

