## 5. Acceptance criteria

Validation will be considered successful when all the following conditions are met:

1. All approved validation protocols are executed.
2. All IQ acceptance criteria pass.
3. All OQ acceptance criteria pass.
4. All PQ acceptance criteria pass.
5. Every requirement has at least one executed verification test.
6. Every risk control has at least one executed verification test.
7. Every requirement is traceable in TM-QM-PILOT-001.
8. No unresolved High risks remain above acceptance thresholds.
9. No unresolved critical deviations remain open.
10. Validation evidence is available and reviewable.

